UPDATE companies SET description='OnBoard Circuits was founded in 2001 in Scottsdale, Arizona. The company is women- and minority-owned.

The shop provides PCB fabrication and assembly services, covering quick-turn prototypes through full-scale production runs. It manages both domestic and offshore manufacturing relationships, and maintains an on-site warehouse to ship repeat orders without quick-turn surcharges. The team supports customers from design and layout through final manufacturing, and offers free tooling on prototype orders.

Customers span military and aerospace programs, home-appliance manufacturers, and university research projects. Long-term clients include companies that have purchased tens of thousands of boards over a decade or more, such as Circle Prime, and the firm also handles one-off repair jobs for legacy electronics.

OnBoard Circuits says its differentiation rests on 25-plus years of industry experience, a network of domestic and offshore partners, on-site warehousing for next-day repeat fulfillment, and a customer-service model that promises 24-hour quote responses, same-day or next-day pricing, and weekend availability. The ownership structure is cited as a deliberate choice to foster a diverse workplace culture.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["PCB fabrication", "PCB assembly", "Quick-turn prototyping", "Full-scale production", "Design and layout support", "Domestic manufacturing", "Offshore manufacturing", "On-site warehousing", "Free tooling on prototypes"], "industries": ["Military", "Aerospace", "Home appliances", "University research"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Over 25 years of PCB industry experience", "Domestic and offshore manufacturing partnerships", "On-site warehousing for next-day repeat order fulfillment", "24-hour quote response; same-day or next-day PCB quotes", "Women- and minority-owned business"], "facts_used": ["Founded 2001 in Scottsdale, AZ -> db", "Women- and minority-owned -> /", "PCB fabrication and assembly services -> /", "Domestic and offshore manufacturing capabilities -> /", "On-site warehousing for repeat orders -> /", "24-hour quote response, same-day/next-day quotes -> /", "Serves military, aerospace, home appliances, university research -> /", "Free tooling on prototypes -> /", "Founder Jay referenced in contact email and reviews -> /", "Address: 8341 East Evans Road, Suite #101, Scottsdale, AZ 85260 -> /"], "company_type": "Contract manufacturer / job shop", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "OnBoard Circuits is your expert comprehensive PCB supplier, delivering top-tier PCB services... Whether you need quick-turn, advanced PCB prototypes, full-scale production, or PCB assembly services, our expert team oversees every step from design 