UPDATE companies SET description='Onofrio''s Ultimate Foods operates from a facility on Wheeler Street in New Haven, Connecticut. The company was established in 2004 as a family-owned venture by partners Richard Onofrio, Vincent Onofrio, and Edward Onofrio, who carried forward a food-service legacy that began at the family''s grocery store in 1923.

The business functions as a contract packer and co-manufacturer, offering private-label food packing, co-packing, food bottling, sauce and marinade bottling, and full-scale food manufacturing. Its plant houses kettles ranging from 50 to 1,000 gallons, automated filler funnels, capping and labeling systems, heat shrink-wrap sealing, laser imprinting for expiration dates and lot codes, a LOCK multi-metal detection system, and large-capacity washing and sterilization equipment. Production runs start at a minimum of 100 cases, with packaging options including glass bottles (8–128 oz), hot-fill plastic bottles (8–128 oz), and sealed pouches (8–128 oz). A production manager and an R&D specialist, each with over 25 years of experience, oversee quality assurance and product development.

Clients range from startup entrepreneurs to established corporate and institutional brands, including nationally recognized names that remain confidential. The company serves the food-service, specialty-food, organic, and natural-products sectors, providing certified packing for Kosher, gluten-free, non-GMO, and organic specifications.

Onofrio''s differentiates itself by not marketing any products under its own label, so client formulations receive undivided attention. The family-owned structure is cited as a guarantee of consistent quality and discretion, and the firm emphasizes end-to-end guidance from recipe development through distribution.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Private label food packing", "Co-packing", "Food bottling", "Sauce and marinade bottling", "Food manufacturing", "Kosher packing", "Gluten-free packing", "Non-GMO packing", "Organic packing", "Recipe development and R&D support", "Quality assurance and production management", "FDA labeling compliance (allergen, nutrition facts)", "UPC bar code procurement", "Automated filling and capping", "Automated labeling application", "Heat shrink-wrap sealing", "Laser imprint expiration and lot coding", "Digital box coding and taping", "Metal detection (LOCK multi-system)", "Automated washing and sterilization", "Kettle processing (50\u20131,000 gal)", "Hot-fill processing", "Glass bottle packaging (8\u2013128 oz)", "Plastic bottle packaging (8\u2013128 oz)"], "industries": ["Food service", "Private label foods", "Specialty foods", "Organic and natural foods", "Corporate and institutional food", "Entrepreneurial food brands"], "materials": ["Glass bottles (8\u2013128 oz)", "Hot-fill plastic bottles (8\u2013128 oz)", "Sealed pouches (8\u2013128 oz)", "Food ingredients (various)"], "equipment": ["50\u20131,000 gallon kettles", "Automated feeder tracking system", "Programmed automated filler funnels", "Automated closer/capping system", "Automated labeling application system", "Heat shrink-wrap seal equipment", "Laser imprint expiration date and lot ID system", "Digital box coder and tape system", "LOCK multi metal detection system", "Large capacity automated washing machine and sterilization"], "volume": "Minimum 100 case runs", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["No proprietary products \u2013 cl