UPDATE companies SET description='Oregon & A to Z Auto Wrecking has served the Portland, Oregon area since its founding in 1937.

Today the company offers auto recycling, auto repair, and a comprehensive inventory of recycled and aftermarket parts. Core offerings include rebuilt transmissions, transfer cases, differential assemblies, and a wide range of electrical and mechanical components such as wiring harnesses, axle assemblies, and 4x4 parts. The facility operates a nationwide parts location service and ships via FedEx, UPS, USPS, and regional freight carriers, while providing free delivery to local repair shops and salvage yards. In-house repair capabilities cover gear ratio changes and steering column work.

The company identifies itself as a supplier of 4x4 parts in the region and serves the automotive repair and recycling sectors.

Oregon & A to Z Auto Wrecking promotes recycled parts as a cost-effective and environmentally responsible alternative, noting that all components are quality-tested before sale and backed by warranties of 30, 60, or 90 days with extended options available. A sales staff with more than 15 years of experience in the auto recycling industry assists customers in locating specific parts.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Auto recycling", "Auto repair", "Transmission rebuilding", "Transfer case rebuilding", "Gear ratio changes", "Steering column repair", "Parts location service", "Nationwide shipping", "Free local delivery", "Car-Part Interchange system"], "industries": ["Automotive repair", "Auto recycling", "4x4 parts supply"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Quality-tested recycled parts", "Nationwide parts location service", "Free local delivery to shops and salvage yards", "Warranties up to 90 days with extended options", "Sales team with 15+ years industry experience"], "facts_used": ["Founded 1937 -> db, homepage", "Located in Portland, Oregon -> db, homepage", "Sells rebuilt transmissions and transfer cases -> homepage", "Offers auto recycling and auto repair -> homepage", "Provides nationwide parts location service -> homepage", "Free delivery to local repair shops and salvage yards -> homepage", "Warranties 30/60/90 day and extended -> homepage", "Sales staff with over 15 years experience -> homepage", "Leading supplier of 4x4 parts in the Northwest -> homepage", "Uses Car-Part Interchange -> homepage", "Ships via FedEx, UPS, USPS, regional freight -> homepage", "Performs gear ratio changes and steering column repairs -> homepage"], "company_type": "Distributor / reseller", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "We sell rebuilt transmissions, transfer cases, and more, plus new and aftermarket parts.", "founded_year": "1937", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "mi