UPDATE companies SET description='Packaging & More, Inc. is based in Central Falls, Rhode Island. The company has been locally owned and operated since 1993. The Fonseca family has roots in the area: Tony Fonseca, a U.S. Navy veteran of the Vietnam War, and his wife Dianne have lived in nearby Smithfield since 1975. Their sons, Tony and Vincent, joined the business full time in 2005.

The company operates as a food service packaging distributor, supplying independent grocers, bakeries, and restaurants across southern New England. It emphasizes a friendly, courteous operation with a focus on premium product lines, competitive delivered pricing, and customer service. The firm also promotes environmentally conscious practices, including fuel-efficient delivery vehicles and affordable green product options.

Customers include independent grocery stores, bakeries, and restaurants in Rhode Island, Massachusetts, and Connecticut. The distributor positions itself as a partner that helps these operators compete on pricing and quality with larger corporations.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Food service packaging distribution", "Delivery services", "Eco-friendly product sourcing"], "industries": ["Food service", "Grocery", "Bakery", "Restaurant", "Food packaging"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Locally owned and operated since 1993", "Family-owned, veteran-led leadership", "Fuel-efficient delivery fleet", "Affordable green product options", "Focus on independent grocers, bakeries, and restaurants"], "facts_used": ["Founded 1993 -> website homepage", "Veteran-owned (Tony Fonseca) -> description", "Family-owned (Fonseca family) -> description", "Headquarters Central Falls, RI -> database", "Industries: independent grocers, bakeries, restaurants -> website homepage", "Green initiatives: fuel-efficient delivery vehicles, affordable green products -> website homepage", "Sons joined 2005 -> description"], "company_type": "Distributor / reseller", "makes_products": "no", "type_evidence": "Packaging & More is the premier food service packaging supplier of independent grocers, bakeries and restaurants in southern New England.", "founded_year": "1993", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": ["Veteran-owned"]}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='packaging-more' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
UPDATE companies SET description='Pahlke Steel, based in Bismarck, North Dakota, traces its roots to 1991 when it began as Pahlke Pipe & Rod, a family-owned operation selling used well pipe and livestock products. The company expanded into new steel products in May 2012, adding structural shapes such as angle, flats, beams, and channels, as well as pipe, sheet, and plate.

Today the business operates as a steel service center and distributor, stocking a broad range of carbon steel, aluminum, stainless, and galvanized products including angle, beams, channels, pipe, sheet, and plate. It also carries fasteners (bolts, nuts, washers, threaded rod, anchors), tools (including DeWALT), industrial supplies (abrasives, sealants, cutting products, safety supplies), and used pipe. The company offers local delivery and can provide material test reports upon request.

Its customer base spans contractors, manufacturers, farms, ranches, and other businesses throughout the Bismarck region and surrounding areas. The company emphasizes a large in-stock inventory to keep projects moving without long lead times.

