UPDATE companies SET description='Panda Apparel LLC operates as Panda Imprinting & Graphics from a 11,500-square-foot production facility in Springfield, New Jersey. The company was founded in 2007 by Scott and Donna Marino, who brought over 65 years of combined apparel industry experience to the venture. The Marino-owned business began as a screen-printing shop and has since expanded into a full-service decoration house with a second retail location in Cranford, NJ.

The shop provides custom apparel decoration through screen printing, embroidery, direct digital printing, and vinyl heat sealing. All production is kept in-house, allowing the team to manage quality and deadlines across runs that range from single-piece orders to large commercial volumes. The facility houses dedicated specialists in graphic art, production scheduling, screen printing, embroidery, packaging, and logistics, and the company also powers Varsity Central, an online platform for spirit wear and varsity jackets.

Clients include local schools, small businesses, national retailers, and Fortune 500 companies, as well as landscapers, contractors, civic groups, non-profits, sports teams, Greek organizations, and event planners for marathons, bridal parties, and family reunions. The company offers group discounts and company-store programs for recurring uniform needs.

Panda Imprinting emphasizes its in-house equipment investment and free virtual proofs as key differentiators, stating that internal production control enables fast, economical turnaround without hidden screen charges. The business was started to deliver high-quality custom products with competitive pricing and unmatched service to a diverse client base.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Screen printing", "Embroidery", "Direct digital printing", "Vinyl heat sealing", "Graphic design", "Virtual proofing", "Custom apparel decoration", "Promotional products", "Team uniforms", "Varsity jackets", "Spiritwear", "Staff apparel", "Lawn sign fundraiser", "Company stores", "Packaging", "Logistics"], "industries": ["Schools", "Small businesses", "National retailers", "Fortune 500 companies", "Landscapers", "Contractors", "Civic groups", "Non-profit organizations", "Sports teams", "Greek life", "Marathons", "Bridal parties", "Sports leagues", "Bar crawls"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "Small boutique orders to large-scale commercial runs", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["In-house production on top-of-the-line machinery for quality and deadline control", "Free virtual proofs for every order before production", "11,500 sq ft Springfield, NJ facility handling both boutique and commercial volumes", "Varsity Central online platform for spirit wear and team uniform stores", "No hidden screen charges or fees on custom printed orders"], "facts_used": ["Founded 2007 by Scott and Donna Marino -> /about", "Headquarters Springfield, NJ -> /about", "Facility 11,500 sq ft -> /about", "Retail store in Cranford, NJ -> /about", "Services: screen printing, embroidery, direct digital printing, vinyl heat sealing -> /about", "In-house production control -> /about", "Varsity Central online platform -> /about", "Client types: schools, small businesses, national retailers, Fortune 500 -> /about", "Additional client types: landscapers, contra