UPDATE companies SET description='Patterson Elite operates from Augusta, Kansas, tracing its roots to 1976 when Allan Patterson turned his garage-based engine-building hobby into a full-time business by 1979. The company remains family-run, with Allan’s son Todd Patterson now operations alongside him.

The shop builds custom race engines and provides a full suite of in-house machining services, including block machining, piston machining, crankshaft balancing, cylinder and line honing, and Superflow engine dyno testing. It also upgrades and customizes COPO Camaros for Sportsman and Factory Stock competition, and acts as a dealer for over 100 high-performance product lines. The staff collectively holds over 100 years of expertise, and every engine is custom engineered, dyno tested, and tuned before it leaves the facility.

Patterson Elite serves drag racers across categories from Sportsman and Competition Eliminator to Factory Stock, Pro Stock, and Pro Stock Truck. Its customers include individual racers and teams looking for turnkey engines, precision machining, or race-ready COPO Camaros, as well as buyers of performance parts from the company’s warehouse outlet.

The company says its differentiation comes from its lightweight piston heritage, in-house coating capabilities for piston skirts and domes, and the 2016 merger with Elite Motorsports that brought world-champion Pro Stock technology into its engine programs. Patterson Elite emphasizes that racers want to buy from someone they trust, and it aims to deliver that trust through custom engineering and race-proven services.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Custom Block Machining", "Custom Piston Machining", "Precision Crank Balancing", "Superflow Engine Dyno Testing", "Lifter Boring", "Cam Tunneling", "Cylinder Boring", "Bore Camshaft Tunnel", "Block Decking", "Line Honing", "Precision Cylinder Honing", "Dome Profile Machining", "Top Gas Porting", "Valve Relief Machining", "CNC Lightening", "Custom Ring Grooving", "In-House Piston Skirt Coating", "Pin Fitting", "Hand Finished Piston Domes", "Dome Mold Digitizing", "Piston Skirt and Dome Coating", "COPO Camaro Upgrades and Customization", "Complete Engine Builds", "Race Car Assembly"], "industries": ["Drag racing", "High-performance automotive", "Motorsports"], "materials": [], "equipment": ["Rottler Diamond honing machine", "Superflow Engine Dyno"], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Custom engines engineered in-house and dyno tested before delivery", "Dealer for over 100 high-performance product lines with drop-ship capability", "In-house piston skirt and dome coating (dry film lubricant and ceramic thermal barrier)", "Merger with Elite Motorsports added Pro Stock championship technology"], "facts_used": ["Headquarters: Augusta, Kansas -> db", "Founded: 1976 -> db", "Founders: Allan Patterson and son Todd Patterson -> /about-us", "Full-time engine building since 1979 -> /about-us", "Family-run business -> /about-us", "Custom race engines built in-house and dyno tested -> /", "Machining services: block, piston, crank balancing, honing, dyno -> /services", "COPO Camaro upgrades and customization -> /, /about-us", "Dealer for over 100 high-performance product lines -> /", "Staff expertise over 100 years -> /services", "Lightweight piston heritage -> /about-us, /services", "In-house piston skirt and dome coating -> /services", "Merger with Elite Motorsports in 2016 -> /about-us", "Serves Sportsman, Competition Eliminator, Factory Stock, Pro Stock, Pro Stock Truck -> /about-us", "Rottler Diamond honing machine -> /services", "Superflow Engine Dyno -> /services"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "Patterson Elite has been building record-setting race engines for over 40 years. Each engine build is custom engineered in-house and dyno tested/tuned prior to leaving our facility.", "founded_year": "1976", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": []}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='patterson-elite' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
UPDATE companies SET description='Paul Mueller Company was founded in 1940 in Springfield, Missouri, when Paul Mueller and Gordon Mann opened Mann and Mueller Heating and Sheet Metal Works. After Mann became ill, Mueller purchased his share in 1943 and renamed the business Paul Mueller Company, incorporating in Missouri in 1946. The company’s first employee, Joe White, later became executive vice president.

The company designs and manufactures stainless steel processing equipment and systems, including tanks and vessels, skids and integrated systems, heat exchangers, refrigeration and chilling units, cleaning systems, and controls. Its primary manufacturing campus in Springfield spans 1,000,000 square feet on nearly 50 acres, with an additional 212,800-square-foot facility in Osceola, Iowa, and production sites in the Netherlands and Vietnam. Branded product lines include Temp‑Plate® heat transfer surfaces, Accu‑Therm® plate heat exchangers, Fre‑Heater® heat‑recovery units, VaPure® vapor‑compression stills, PyroPure® water purification systems, and EmBee milk coolers — over 72,000 of which have been installed in approximately 125 countries.

The company’s stated purpose is “Creating Quality for Life.” It differentiates itself through a global network of expert service vendors capable of handling tight‑space installations and aggressive shutdown schedules, a culture of open‑book management that gives every coworker a financial stake in the outcome, and a focus on seamless production transitions during system upgrades.', certifications=ARRAY['ASME certification for pressure vessels']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Stainless steel equipment design and manufacturing", "Pressure vessel fabrication (ASME certified)", "Heat exchanger manufacturing (Temp\u2011Plate\u00ae, Accu\u2011Therm\u00ae)", "Refrigeration and chilling systems", "Cleaning systems (CIP)", "Controls and automation integration", "Field service and repairs", "On\u2011site fabrication and installation", "Parts supply and replacement", "Process system integration (skids)", "Dairy farm milk cooling systems", "Beverage fermentation and storage tanks", "Pharmaceutical and bioprocess equipment", "Water purification systems (PyroPure\u00ae)", "Vapor compression distillation (VaPure\u00ae)", "Heat recovery systems (Fre\u2011Heater\u00ae)"], "industries": ["Animal Health", "Brewing", "Calibration", "Consumer Beverage", "Chemical", "Dairy Farm", "Dairy Processing", "Data Centers", "Food", "Heat Transfer", "HVAC", "Marine", "Oil & Gas", "Over-the-Road Shipping", "Personal Care", "Pharmaceutical", "Spirits", "Tank Components", "Wine"], "materials": ["Stainless steel"], "equipment": ["Temp\u2011Plate\u00ae heat transfer surface", "Accu\u2011Therm\u00ae plate heat exchanger", "Fre\u2011Heater\u00ae heat recovery unit", "VaPure\u00ae vapor compression still", "PyroPure\u00ae water purification system", "EmBee milk cooler", "Mueller stainless steel wine barrel"], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Global service vendor network for unique service needs", "Experience with tight spaces and aggressive shutdown schedules", "Seamle