UPDATE companies SET description='Pearson Foods Corporation operates from Grand Rapids, Michigan.

Today the business runs a 100,000-square-foot, state-of-the-art facility with 15 production lines and a fleet of more than 30 refrigerated trucks and trailers. With 200-plus employees across two locations, Pearson Foods produces fresh-cut produce, private-label items, retail deli and meat products, foodservice ingredients, and school meal solutions. Its capabilities include hydroponic bean sprout cultivation in an SQF Level II environment, sous-vide ready-to-eat proteins, and modified-atmosphere packaging for extended shelf life. The company also operates Pearson Logistics, providing direct distribution to 14 states.

Customers include the nation’s largest retailers, foodservice operators, and ingredient manufacturers across the retail produce, deli, meat, and further-processing segments. School nutrition programs are also served.

Pearson Foods emphasizes a culture of food safety, citing its SQF certification and a zero-waste loop that sends produce byproducts to local farms. Its transportation division uses clean-diesel technology with temperature monitoring, and packaging initiatives focus on recyclability. An internal research-and-development team works to anticipate consumer trends and bring competitively priced products to market.', certifications=ARRAY['SQF Level II']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Fresh-cut produce processing", "Private label manufacturing", "Retail produce, deli, and meat packaging", "Foodservice ingredient supply", "School meal solutions", "Hydroponic bean sprout cultivation", "Sous vide ready-to-eat protein production", "Modified atmosphere packaging", "Fresh food manufacturing", "Distribution and logistics (Pearson Logistics)", "Research and development", "Sustainability programs (zero waste, clean ship, recycled materials)"], "industries": ["Retail produce", "Retail deli", "Retail meat", "Foodservice", "Ingredient manufacturing", "Schools"], "materials": ["Fresh produce", "Hydroponic bean sprouts", "Sous vide proteins", "Modified atmosphere packaging films"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["SQF Level II certified hydroponic bean sprout production", "14-state direct-distribution network via Pearson Logistics", "Zero-waste program diverting produce byproducts to local farms", "Clean-diesel refrigerated fleet with real-time temperature monitoring", "Dedicated R&D team developing trend-forward fresh products"], "facts_used": ["Headquarters in Grand Rapids, Michigan -> db", "Founded over four decades ago as two-person sprout operation -> /about-us", "100,000 SF state-of-the-art facility -> /about-us", "200+ employees -> /about-us", "15 production lines -> /about-us", "30+ trucks & refrigerated trailers -> /about-us", "14 state direct-distribution capabilities -> /about-us", "SQF Level II certified environment for hy