UPDATE companies SET description='Peninsula Foodservice, a USDA-certified food processing and distribution company, was founded in 2007 by Michael Altif in Orlando, Florida. The family-owned business traces its roots to 1992 when Altif launched his first USDA-certified processing and distribution operation.

