UPDATE companies SET description='Petro Packaging Company, Inc. operates from Cranford, New Jersey, where it was founded in 1960. The business remains a third‑generation, family‑owned and operated plastic extrusion facility. In the 1960s the company pioneered the extrusion of CAB, CAP, and PETG resins, establishing an early reputation in the plastics industry.

The company specializes in custom plastic extrusion, producing open‑end tubes, packaging tubes, clear containers, and profile extrusions. Its capabilities include profile extrusion, tube extrusion, container extrusion, engineering services, and in‑house tooling design and manufacture.

Petro Packaging serves distributors, OEMs, and Fortune 500 companies across a variety of industries. Its customer base includes industrial leaders who rely on the company for repeatable, high‑performance tubing and profiles, with testimonials referencing decades‑long partnerships in sectors that demand consistent quality and on‑time delivery.

The company differentiates itself through short communication channels between engineering, project management, and senior leadership, a commitment to transparency, and a sustainability program that incorporates Post‑Industrial Recyclate (PIR) into product lines. Its founding focus on material innovation and its ongoing investment in precision equipment underscore a strategy built on reliability and technical flexibility.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Custom Plastic Extrusion", "Profile Extrusion", "Tube Extrusion", "Container Extrusion", "Engineering Services", "In\u2011house Tooling Design", "Tooling Manufacturing", "Added\u2011value Tooling Development", "Stock Extrusion Programs", "Open\u2011End Tubes", "Packaging Tubes", "Clear Containers", "Integrated Tube Extrusion Services"], "industries": [], "materials": ["CAB", "CAP", "PETG", "Thermoplastic materials", "Post\u2011Industrial Recyclate (PIR)"], "equipment": ["Energy\u2011efficient extruders", "Servo\u2011driven downstream extrusion equipment", "In\u2011house extrusion tooling"], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Third\u2011generation family ownership since 1960", "Pioneered CAB, CAP, and PETG extrusion in the 1960s", "In\u2011house tooling design and manufacturing", "Post\u2011Industrial Recyclate (PIR) sustainability program", "Multi\u2011million\u2011dollar energy\u2011efficient facility renovation"], "facts_used": ["Founded 1960 -> db", "Headquarters Cranford, NJ -> db", "Third-generation family-owned -> /, /about", "Pioneered CAB, CAP, PETG in 1960s -> /, /about", "Custom extrusion of tubes, containers, profiles -> /", "Engineering services and in-house tooling -> /about", "15000+ clients, 60 years, 3 generations -> /", "Energy-efficient facility renovation details -> /about", "Servo-driven downstream equipment -> /about", "PIR recycling program -> /", "Serves distributors, OEMs, Fortune 500 -> /", "Materials: CAB, CAP, PETG, PIR -> /, /about"