UPDATE companies SET description='Pine Electronics, Inc. operates from Grove City, Pennsylvania, at the intersection of Interstates 79 and 80. The company serves as an electronics and electromechanical assembly contract manufacturer for industrial equipment OEMs across the United States.

The firm specializes in low- to mid-volume production, offering through-hole and surface-mount PCB assembly, cable and wire harness fabrication, box build integration, and full electromechanical assembly. A collective workforce of more than 100 employees supports these services from a facility the company describes as state-of-the-art.

Pine''s customer base spans mass transit, mining, electrical transmission, rail, and communications sectors, serving both multinational corporations and regional businesses. Each client is assigned a dedicated representative to handle commercial and technical inquiries, a model intended to streamline communication and accelerate project development.

Quality assurance is anchored by an ISO 9001:2015 certified system, with IPC-certified trainers on staff for IPC-A-610 and IPC/WHMA-A-620 standards. An auditor noted the company''s proprietary ERP software, which optimizes cycle counting for high-usage or problematic parts, as an innovative feature for a company of its size.', certifications=ARRAY['ISO 9001:2015','IPC-A-610','IPC/WHMA-A-620']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Through-hole PCB assembly", "Surface mount PCB assembly", "Box build assembly", "Cable assembly", "Wire harness assembly", "Electromechanical assembly", "Engineering collaboration", "IPC-A-610 inspection", "IPC/WHMA-A-620 inspection", "Quality management (ISO 9001:2015)", "Proprietary ERP system for inventory optimization"], "industries": ["Mass transit", "Mining", "Electrical transmission", "Rail", "Communications", "Industrial equipment OEMs"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "Low-mid volume", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Dedicated customer representative for all commercial and technical questions", "ISO 9001:2015 certified quality management system", "IPC-certified trainers for IPC-A-610 and IPC/WHMA-A-620 inspection standards", "Proprietary ERP software enabling optimized cycle counts for critical parts", "Low- to mid-volume specialization with full-service PCB assembly and box build integration"], "facts_used": ["Location: Grove City, Pennsylvania -> /about-us", "Contract manufacturer for industrial equipment OEMs -> /about-us", "Low-mid volume specialization -> /", "Through-hole and surface mount PCB assembly -> /about-us", "Cable, wire harness, box build, electromechanical assembly -> /about-us", "More than 100 employees collectively -> /about-us", "Industries: mass transit, mining, electrical transmission, rail, communications -> /about-us", "Dedicated customer representative model -> /", "ISO 9001:2015 certification -> /quality", "IPC-A-610 and IPC/WHMA-A-620 certified trainers -> /quality", "Propriet