UPDATE companies SET description='Pioneer Automotive Industries was founded in 1946 by Herman A. Shields in Meridian, Mississippi. The company began as a manufacturer of engine and transmission components. Over the decades it changed hands several times: acquired by The Barnes Group in 1979, then by UIS Inc. in 1993, then by United Components (part of The Carlyle Group) in 2003, then ownership transitioned to Doron Arad in 2006, and later joined The Lodi Group in 2009–2010. In 2017 it acquired ATP Automotive and expanded its Meridian facility to 300,000 square feet in 2018.

Today Pioneer operates a 300,000 sq ft manufacturing and distribution facility in Meridian, producing over 15,000 SKUs of powertrain and transmission components. Its product lines include flexplates, flywheels, automatic and manual transmission shift cables, clutch cables, speedometer cables, engine mounts, harmonic balancers, and a range of high‑performance parts. The company designs, manufactures, and distributes these components for the automotive aftermarket.

Pioneer serves customers and distributors throughout the United States, Canada, and Latin America.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Powertrain component manufacturing", "Transmission component manufacturing", "Engine mount manufacturing", "Cable assembly manufacturing", "Flexplate and flywheel manufacturing", "Harmonic balancer manufacturing", "Distribution and logistics", "Product design and engineering"], "industries": ["Automotive aftermarket", "Powertrain", "Transmission"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["300,000 sq ft manufacturing and distribution facility", "Over 15,000 SKUs in powertrain and transmission components", "Serves customers across North and South America", "Decades of engineering expertise in automotive aftermarket"], "facts_used": ["Founded 1946 by Herman A. Shields -> /about-us", "Headquarters in Meridian, Mississippi -> db", "300,000 sq ft facility -> /about-us", "15,000+ SKUs -> /about-us", "Manufactures powertrain and transmission components -> /about-us", "Serves customers across North and South America -> /", "Mission to design, manufacture, distribute high quality powertrain components -> /about-us", "Acquired ATP Automotive in 2017 -> /about-us", "Expanded facility in 2018 -> /about-us", "Ownership transitions: Doron Arad 2006, UCI 2003, Lodi Group 2009-2010 -> /about-us"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "Since 1946, Pioneer Automotive Industries has been dedicated to manufacturing and distributing high-quality powertrain and transmission components.", "founded_year": "1946", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": []}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='pioneer-automotive-industries-llc' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
UPDATE companies SET description='Pizza Solutions is based in Nicholasville, Kentucky, and traces its origins to 1919. The company operates as a distributor of commercial kitchen equipment, though details about its founding ownership or early history are not publicly disclosed.

The firm supplies a broad range of equipment for foodservice operations, including conveyor and deck ovens, refrigeration units, prep tables, sinks, dough processing machines, ventilation, and furniture. It carries brands such as Edge Ovens, Moretti Forni, Arctic, Frosty Factory, Tecnoeka, Flash Furniture, and Serv-Ware. Services include warranty support, financing through a partner called APPROVE, and free freight quotes.

