UPDATE companies SET description='Plastic Design & Manufacturing (PDM Plastics) was founded in 1998 in Manhattan, Montana, as a full-service consulting firm developing turnkey manufacturing programs for the sporting, industrial, and automotive markets. The company transitioned to direct manufacturing in 2009 with a custom-built factory in southwest Montana, and later expanded to molding operations in Juárez, Mexico, and Shenzhen, China, for production tooling and sourcing.

Today PDM operates two primary production plants—its headquarters in Manhattan, Montana, and a facility in Juárez, Mexico—running 22 injection molding machines ranging from 50 to 1,400 tons. The company provides custom injection molding, tooling design and build, assembly, packaging, decoration, design assistance, prototyping, and secondary operations, serving high- to medium-volume plastic component needs.

PDM serves a diverse industrial base including automotive, electronics, medical, industrial equipment, sporting goods and firearms, pet products, agricultural, construction, consumer goods, and battery components.

