UPDATE companies SET description='Plastics Plus operates from Bismarck, North Dakota, where it was founded in January 1998 by a hobby woodworker who needed a small piece of Plexiglas for a project. The company has since grown into a manufacturer of custom plastic fabrications and standard acrylic displays, selling across the United States and Canada.

Its Bismarck facility handles orders ranging from a few pieces to several thousand units, with cut‑to‑size sheet stock also available.

Plastics Plus serves businesses, organizations, and individuals in healthcare (hospitals and clinics use chart holders and bio card holders), retail and marketing (point‑of‑purchase signage, trade‑show displays), funeral homes, construction (window well covers), and safety (glove box holders). Government and civic customers purchase ballot boxes, while distributors benefit from blind‑shipping and multi‑location fulfillment.

The founder’s original need for a single plastic piece shaped a culture of no minimum orders, no broken‑case fees, and free estimates on custom work. The company emphasizes made‑in‑America production — virtually all items are fabricated in‑house — along with fast turnaround times and personal customer service as its primary differentiators.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Custom plastic fabrication", "Cut-to-size plastic sheeting", "Acrylic sign holder manufacturing", "Brochure holder manufacturing", "Ballot and donation box fabrication", "Acrylic riser and display fabrication", "Outdoor weather-resistant plastic fabrication", "Blind shipping", "Multi-location order fulfillment", "Custom design assistance"], "industries": ["Healthcare (hospitals, clinics)", "Retail and point-of-purchase marketing", "Trade shows, conventions, conferences", "Funeral homes", "Construction (window well covers)", "Safety equipment (glove box holders)", "Government and civic (ballot boxes)", "Distribution and wholesale"], "materials": ["Acrylic", "Polycarbonate", "PVC", "PETG", "ABS", "HDPE"], "equipment": [], "volume": "Few pieces to several thousand units", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["No minimum order quantities or broken-case fees", "Blind shipping and multi\u2011location distribution", "Fast turnaround times on custom and standard orders", "Virtually all products made in\u2011house at Bismarck, ND facility", "Free estimates on custom designs"], "facts_used": ["Founded 1998 -> db, /about-us", "Headquarters Bismarck, North Dakota -> db, /about-us", "Started by hobby woodworker needing Plexiglas -> /about-us", "Manufacturer of virtually all items sold -> /about-us", "Materials: acrylic, polycarbonate, PVC, PETG, ABS, HDPE -> /about-us, /", "No minimum order quantities -> /, /about-us", "Blind shipping and multi-location distribution -> /", "Fast turnaround times -> /about-us", "Product catalog includes sign holders, brochure holders, ris